{"resourceIdentifier":"3322","resourceName":"BEYAZ PİRAMİT BIOGAS PROJECT","description":"Beyaz Piramit Biogas project is a biogas to-energy project that will generate renewable energy by capturing biogas from animal manure -via anaerobic digestion- and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through biogas systems. The project is being implemented by BEYAZ PİRAMİT TARIM HAYVANCILIK ENERJİ EĞİTİM VE DANIŞMANLIK A.Ş., as the Project Owner, in Çumra district, KONYA province, in Turkey. From a socio-economic perspective, agricultural activities and animal husbandry have historically been primary household income sources for those living in Cumra Region. it is estimated that approximately 550 tons of cattle manure generated at animal farms will be collected daily through special sewage trucks equipped with close-tanks to prevent any odor and/or manure leakages and to be fed into the anaerobic digesters at the proposed biogas power plant The proposed project activity has two biogas engines installed at the biogas power plant, with 3.002 MWe. The manure produced by 12,650 dairy cattle and 2,110,000 hens located on neighboring farms is collected and fed into the anaerobic digesters at the project site.The expected average annual emission reductions are 354,263 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 2,479,844 tCO2eq emissions reduction during the first crediting period and 7,439,533 tCO2eq emissions reduction throughout its three crediting periods for a total of 21 years.","location":{"latitude":37.611632,"longitude":32.725127},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-07-25","endExclusive":"2022-08-25","endInclusive":"2022-08-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3322"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CUMRA"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"104897"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/05/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 31/10/2020 - 30/10/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=68486&IDKEY=a8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0m94442194","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Joint-Draft-Project Description-V4.1-Beyaz Piramit BIOGAS PLANT 20_06_2022_Rev_00.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-06-20T09:27:29.977Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=68484&IDKEY=s0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9494439436","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS_Listing Represantation_Multiple Represantation_V4.1_Beyaz Piramit_15-06-2022.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-06-20T09:26:37.897Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=131324&IDKEY=n8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq03181095796","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"vcs-PD-V4.2-Ver 09-ID3322_Beyaz Piramit Biogas Project_11_03_25_CL_.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-05-05T05:49:09.05Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=106901&IDKEY=0903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmas